<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Onboarding Completed</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f7f9fc; margin:
      0; padding: 20px; color: #333; } .email-container { max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 30px; border-radius:
      12px; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); } .header { background-color:
      #198754; color: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
      font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; } .content {
      padding: 20px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; } .cta-button { display:
      inline-block; background-color: #007bff; color: white; padding: 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; } .footer {
      margin-top: 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: #888; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='email-container'>
      <div class='header'>
        🎉 Onboarding Complete
      </div>
      <div class='content'>
        <p>Hi <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
        <p>Congratulations! You’ve successfully completed all the onboarding
          steps:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>👥 Added your first team member</li>
          <li>🔗 Connected the EngageGPT Chrome Extension</li>
          <li>📊 Synced your LinkedIn profile</li>
        </ul>

        <p>You’re now fully ready to use all EngageGPT features:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>🚀 Explore the Dashboard</li>
          <li>✍️ Generate LinkedIn content in seconds</li>
          <li>💬 Create engaging comments with AI</li>
          <li>📥 Save and organize posts automatically</li>
          <li>📆 Plan and schedule using the Content Calendar</li>
          <li>🔄 Automate posting and much more...</li>
        </ul>

        <p style='text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;'>
          <a
            class='cta-button'
            href='https://engagegpt.in/dashboard'
            target='_blank'
          >Go to Dashboard</a>
        </p>

        <p>If you ever need assistance, just hit reply or visit our Support
          page.</p>
        <p>Welcome aboard 🎉,<br />The EngageGPT Team</p>
      </div>
      <div class='footer'>
        &copy;
        {{year}}
        EngageGPT. All rights reserved.<br />
        <a href='https://engagegpt.in'>engagegpt.in</a>
        |
        <a href='mailto:engagegpt@gmail.com'>Support</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>